    "\\n            - 当前没有可复用的既有标签；只有在标签确实表达不同分类时才新增。\\n            ": "\\n            - No reusable existing tags are available; add a new tag only when it represents a genuinely different category.\\n            ",
    "\\n            场景：旅行手账素材。\\n            当前临时名称：\\\\(request.currentTitle)\\n\\n            请识别图片中的地点、票据、纪念品、餐食、交通工具、建筑或其他旅行素材名称，并给出分类标签。\\n            标签优先使用旅行手账分类，例如 景点、交通、餐饮、票据、纪念品、地图、建筑、自然、人物。\\n            quantity 和 expirationDate 固定输出 null。\\n            \\\\(tagReuseInstructions)\\n\\n            \\\\(schema)\\n            ": "\\n            Scene: travel journal material.\\n            Current temporary name: \\\\(request.currentTitle)\\n\\n            Identify the place, ticket, souvenir, meal, transport, building, or other travel material in the image, and provide category tags.\\n            Prefer travel journal categories such as attractions, transport, dining, tickets, souvenirs, maps, architecture, nature, and people.\\n            Always output null for quantity and expirationDate.\\n            \\\\(tagReuseInstructions)\\n\\n            \\\\(schema)\\n            ",
    "\\n            场景：物品收纳。\\n            当前临时名称：\\\\(request.currentTitle)\\n\\n            请识别图片中的收纳物品名称和分类标签。\\n            额外要求：\\n            - 如果图片中能看出同类物品数量，请填写 quantity；如果不能确定，填写 null。\\n            - 如果包装上能明确读到保质期/到期日，请填写 expirationDate，格式 YYYY-MM-DD；如果只有生产日期、保质期时长或无法读清，填写 null。\\n            - 标签优先使用家庭收纳分类，例如 食品、药品、清洁用品、厨房用品、文具、数码配件、衣物、工具、证件。\\n            \\\\(tagReuseInstructions)\\n\\n            \\\\(schema)\\n            ": "\\n            Scene: home storage.\\n            Current temporary name: \\\\(request.currentTitle)\\n\\n            Identify the stored item name and category tags in the image.\\n            Extra requirements:\\n            - If the image shows the quantity of similar items, fill quantity; otherwise use null.\\n            - If the package clearly shows an expiration date, fill expirationDate in YYYY-MM-DD format; otherwise use null.\\n            - Prefer home storage categories such as food, medicine, cleaning supplies, kitchenware, stationery, digital accessories, clothing, tools, and documents.\\n            \\\\(tagReuseInstructions)\\n\\n            \\\\(schema)\\n            ",
    "\\n            场景：菜谱素材。\\n            当前临时名称：\\\\(request.currentTitle)\\n\\n            请识别图片中的食材、菜品、调料或厨房用品名称，并给出分类标签。\\n            标签优先使用菜谱分类，例如 食材、主食、蔬菜、肉类、海鲜、调料、厨具、成品菜、饮品。\\n            quantity 和 expirationDate 固定输出 null。\\n            \\\\(tagReuseInstructions)\\n\\n            \\\\(schema)\\n            ": "\\n            Scene: recipe material.\\n            Current temporary name: \\\\(request.currentTitle)\\n\\n            Identify the ingredient, dish, seasoning, or kitchenware in the image, and provide category tags.\\n            Prefer recipe categories such as ingredients, staple food, vegetables, meat, seafood, seasonings, kitchenware, prepared dishes, and drinks.\\n            Always output null for quantity and expirationDate.\\n            \\\\(tagReuseInstructions)\\n\\n            \\\\(schema)\\n            ",
    "\\n        - 先从既有标签中选择；如果既有标签和你想输出的标签同义、近义、上下位可归类，必须输出既有标签原名，不要新增相近词。\\n        - 只有所有既有标签都不符合图片分类时，才新增简短名词标签。\\n        - 既有标签：\\\\(cleanNames.joined(separator: ": "\\n        - Choose from existing tags first. If an existing tag is synonymous, similar, or can cover your intended tag, output the existing tag name and do not add a near-duplicate.\\n        - Add a short noun tag only when none of the existing tags fit the image category.\\n        - Existing tags: \\\\(cleanNames.joined(separator: ",
